  "html": "\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"row cols-3\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"564\" height=\"442\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/06/Grow_together_V1-removebg-preview.png\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/leadership/\">Our Leaders</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/sunday-study-group/\">Study Group</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/youth-volunteers/\">Opportunities</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Our Mission</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span>For more than five years, we have been supporting the theme of helping others- by promoting the physical, mental, and spiritual prosperity of the Chinese-American community.</span></p><p>Our projects focus on helping others and focusing on the theme of education.</p><p>We serve the community through our various health fairs and fundraisers, aimed at the underprivileged, the ill, and the elderly with our team of volunteers, specialists, and resources.</p><p>We help children excel in school through carefully planned tutoring lessons with handpicked tutors that fit their needs, offered throughout the summer.</p><p>As high schoolers, we are not professionals, doctors, pastors, or coaches, however, we deeply value spreading joy and happiness as well as education for a better future, which is why we have embarked on such programs and events described above.</p><p>Our Youth Volunteers have been an essential part of in supporting the welfare of the Chinese-American Community in North Carolina.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"808\" height=\"607\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/05/P1040392.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"809\" height=\"607\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/05/IMG_0416.jpg\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"310\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/05/IMG_1405.jpg\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></section>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"row cols-4\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Gather Love</h4>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Convey Love</h4>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Share Love</h4>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Witness Love</h4>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></section>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row cols-9\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>PO Box 2422,&nbsp;</b><b>Matthews, NC 28106</b></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>+1 704-839-9583</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>ollietreefoundation@gmail.com</strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Copyright © 2024 OllieTree Foundation</strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n"
